a4fb106391234bf696b7797fc2f2","quote":"• our ability to retain and attract top talent;","context":"• the U.S. presidential and midterm election cycles potentially leading to higher revenue generation compared to non-election years;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":229,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-068598","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001851003","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1851003/000119312526068598/zeta-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8b14a281d2f141db3ab8274c96d7348d8219347aa8537973dcb6555ff54c17c5.bin","sha256":"8b14a281d2f141db3ab8274c96d7348d8219347aa8537973dcb6555ff54c17c5"}},{"id":"42339848a1deb15c32f7db188d5379b431b615cc165bd0e8ad4f8fe989302bc0","quote":"• our ability to anticipate or respond to changes in the competitive landscape, or improvements in the functionality of competing solutions that reduce or eliminate one or more of our competitive advantages;","context":"• our ability to retain and attract top talent;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":230,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-068598","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001851003","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1851003/000119312526068598/zeta-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8b14a281d2f141db3ab8274c96d7348d8219347aa8537973dcb6555ff54c17c5.bin","sha256":"8b14a281d2f141db3ab8274c96d7348d8219347aa8537973dcb6555ff54c17c5"}},{"id":"0aebb210346b930f327b8ecc3ef50b5cb90054943e0ccff6ace48602cdb0e9e7","quote":"• our ability to maintain and expand our relationships with data centers and strategic third-party technology vendors, who provide floor space, bandwidth, cooling and physical security services on which our platform operates;","context":"10","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":232,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-068598","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001851003","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1851003/000119312526068598/zeta-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8b14a281d2f141db3ab8274c96d7348d8219347aa8537973dcb6555ff54c17c5.bin","sha256":"8b14a281d2f141db3ab8274c96d7348d8219347aa8537973dcb6555ff54c17c5"}},{"id":"0935b6d55ddb3e77675fd819e1a0dc75f5a96bbe917597f036a5bd60f8564131","quote":"• our ability to successfully expand our business internationally;","context":"• our ability to maintain and expand our relationships with data centers and strategic third-party technology vendors, who provide floor space, bandwidth, cooling and physical security services on which our platform operates;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":233,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-068598","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001851003","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1851003/000119312526068598/zeta-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8b14a281d2f141db3ab8274c96d7348d8219347aa8537973dcb6555ff54c17c5.bin","sha256":"8b14a281d2f141db3ab8274c96d7348d8219347aa8537973dcb6555ff54c17c5"}},{"id":"8af713346864d896b609e095b34bf19f9b035bf0e8aa1a4f8b64b9bba5e3c72e","quote":"• the emergence of significant privacy, data protection, security or other threats, regulations or requirements applicable to our business and shifting views and behaviors of consumers concerning use of data and data privacy;","context":"• our ability to successfully expand our business internationally;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":234,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-068598","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001851003","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1851003/000119312526068598/zeta-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8b14a281d2f141db3ab8274c96d7348d8219347aa8537973dcb6555ff54c17c5.bin","sha256":"8b14a281d2f141db3ab8274c96d7348d8219347aa8537973dcb6555ff54c17c5"}},{"id":"d5c197a5f335c8c701c30bf9805a8fd10490949797955f39a1bab6b6bf13d6f3","quote":"• general economic and market conditions, including as a result of changes in U.S. trade policies, such as new or increased tariffs and retaliatory responses from other countries, and the resulting impact on our customers’ businesses;","context":"• the emergence of significant privacy, data protection, security or other threats, regulations or requirements applicable to our business and shifting views and behaviors of consumers concerning use of data and data privacy;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":235,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-068598","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001851003","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1851003/000119312526068598/zeta-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8b14a281d2f141db3ab8274c96d7348d8219347aa8537973dcb6555ff54c17c5.bin","sha256":"8b14a281d2f141db3ab8274c96d7348d8219347aa8537973dcb6555ff54c17c5"}},{"id":"a5cafa72fa7a3cd3a2c0e26c9400d58b6975fe473aec4577d2edd1ad8f513c9f","quote":"• extraordinary expenses, such as litigation or other dispute-related settlement payments; and","context":"• general economic and market conditions, including as a result of changes in U.S. trade policies, such as new or increased tariffs and retaliatory responses from other countries, and the resulting impact on our customers’ businesses;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":236,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_d